  "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Date Khaas — Your photo. Your terms. Your match.</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f8f4ef;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f8f4ef;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 16px;\">\n\n<!-- CARD -->\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n\n  <!-- HEADER BAND -->\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"background:#003527;padding:22px 36px;\">\n      <span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:400;color:#e9c176;letter-spacing:0.04em;\">Date Khaas</span>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <!-- HERO TEXT -->\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:44px 36px 28px 36px;\">\n      <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:34px;line-height:42px;font-weight:400;color:#1a1208;\">There is someone written for you.<br>You deserve to find them safely.</h1>\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#4a3d2c;\">The longing for a loving marriage — one full of <em>sukoon</em>, mercy, and companionship — is one of the most human things there is. Islam calls this a sign among His signs: that He created for you a mate, so you may find tranquillity in each other.</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#4a3d2c;\">But the path to that person must feel safe. Your family needs to trust the process. And you need to know that the face you are presented with is real, verified, and honourable — not a shadow or a pretence.</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#4a3d2c;\">That is exactly what we built Date Khaas to be.</p>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <!-- DIVIDER -->\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:0 36px;\"><div style=\"height:1px;background:#e9c176;opacity:0.35;\"></div></td></tr>\n\n  <!-- THREE TRUST PILLARS -->\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:36px 36px 12px 36px;\">\n      <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:400;color:#003527;letter-spacing:0.02em;\">How we protect what matters</h2>\n\n      <!-- PILLAR 1 -->\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px;width:100%;\">\n        <tr>\n          <td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:44px;padding-top:2px;\">\n            <div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;background:#003527;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;line-height:36px;\">\n              <span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;color:#e9c176;\">&#128247;</span>\n            </div>\n          </td>\n          <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-left:14px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#003527;margin-bottom:6px;\">Your photos are yours alone</div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5c4d38;\">Photos are blurred by default. You choose, one by one, who may see them. No stranger browsing. No screenshot farming. Your image is released only when you decide someone is worth knowing.</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- PILLAR 2 -->\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px;width:100%;\">\n        <tr>\n          <td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:44px;padding-top:2px;\">\n            <div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;background:#003527;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;line-height:36px;\">\n              <span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;color:#e9c176;\">&#10003;</span>\n            </div>\n          </td>\n          <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-left:14px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#003527;margin-bottom:6px;\">Every profile is verified before you see it</div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5c4d38;\">Government ID, selfie match, phone verification — we confirm the person is real before they can reach you. You are not browsing a directory of strangers. You are meeting people who have been held to a standard of honesty.</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- PILLAR 3 -->\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;width:100%;\">\n        <tr>\n          <td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:44px;padding-top:2px;\">\n            <div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;background:#003527;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;line-height:36px;\">\n              <span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;color:#e9c176;\">&#128106;</span>\n            </div>\n          </td>\n          <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-left:14px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#003527;margin-bottom:6px;\">Your wali can be part of the journey</div>\n            <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5c4d38;\">Invite your father, brother, or trusted elder to your account. They can follow conversations with you, offer guidance, and give your family the peace of mind they deserve — because a nikah is not just between two people.</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <!-- DIVIDER -->\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:20px 36px 0 36px;\"><div style=\"height:1px;background:#e9c176;opacity:0.35;\"></div></td></tr>\n\n  <!-- CLOSING WARMTH -->\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:32px 36px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:28px;font-weight:400;color:#1a1208;font-style:italic;\">\"And He placed between you affection and mercy.\"<br><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-style:normal;color:#8a7055;\">— Quran 30:21</span></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#4a3d2c;\">You deserve a search that honours the weight of what you are looking for. Join thousands of Muslim men and women who are taking this step — carefully, faithfully, and with their families beside them.</p>\n      <a href=\"https://datekhaas.com/join\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#003527;color:#e9c176;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:3px;letter-spacing:0.03em;\">Begin your search — it's free</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n\n  <!-- FOOTER -->\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"background:#003527;padding:24px 36px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#a0c4b8;line-height:20px;\">Date Khaas &middot; datekhaas.com &middot; A Muslim matrimony app built on trust.<br>You are receiving this because you expressed interest in Date Khaas. <a href=\"https://datekhaas.com/unsubscribe\" style=\"color:#e9c176;\">Unsubscribe</a></p>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n\n</table>\n<!-- /CARD -->\n\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
